      "message": "v0.4.0 — EXPERIMENTAL mode consolidates PREDICTING + BACKTESTING\n\nMode.EXPERIMENTAL (6th dispatcher mode):\n- enter_experimental(scenarios, replay_chain=None)\n  - pure PREDICTING if no chain\n  - BACKTESTING if replay chain provided\n- compare_scenarios(scenario_ids) returns divergence scores\n- exit_experimental() returns to PAUSED\n\n6 new tests (37 total, was 31):\n- experimental_pure_predicting\n- experimental_with_replay_is_backtesting\n- experimental_exits_to_paused\n- compare_scenarios_returns_dict\n- compare_scenarios_only_in_experimental\n- experimental_multi_scenario_promises\n\nAll 31 prior tests still pass.",
