      "message": "cellforge v0.2.0: REWINDING mode + REPLAY_CELL\n\nAdversary Round 6 (seed_pro) prioritized: REWINDING + REPLAY_CELL are\nthe v0.2 killer, not all 7 dispatcher modes. Ship the minimal version.\n\nAdded:\n- Mode.REWINDING (4th mode) — read-only backward traversal\n- Dispatcher.rewind_to(target_tick) — sets mode, target, rewinding flag\n- ReplayCell dataclass — captures witness chain snapshot\n  - integrity_check() verifies parent hash chain\n  - event_at_tick(tick) retrieves specific event\n- Workbook.add_replay(replay) — write-lock-protected\n- Workbook.capture_replay(replay_id, zone_id) — snapshot current witness_log\n- Workbook write-lock extends to REWINDING mode (read-only)\n- Dispatcher.tick_window — for Qwen-Max-Thinking Theme 23 (learning windows)\n\n5 new tests (25/25 total):\n- rewind_to_tick_n\n- rewind_blocked_when_no_ticks_happened\n- rewind_blocks_writes_to_canon\n- replay_cell_integrity\n- pause_rewind_change_resume_diverges (the v0.2 killer)\n\nREADME updated with the second killer demo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mavis <noreply@anthropic.com>",
