      "message": "cellforge v0.1.2: JEV oracle integration\n\nAdded cellforge/jev.py — canonical gate using JEV (Joint Embedding Validator)\nat api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone.\n\nJEV verdict (live query, jev-1.13.0):\n- canon_score: 0.73 (Solid canon-worthy, conf 0.66)\n- paradigm_shift: 0.74 (Notable shift, conf 0.65)\n- is_inversion: 0.86 (yes — the town-and-laborers inversion is real)\n- is_canon yes/no: 0.28 (keep building — promotion not yet automatic)\n\nHelpers:\n- jev_oracle(state, questions) — direct JEV query\n- canon_gate(state, threshold) — normalized gate for promotion\n  returns {gate_passed: bool, canon_score, is_canon, details}\n\n20/20 tests pass (was 18, +2 for jev_helper_smoke, canon_gate_shape).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mavis <noreply@anthropic.com>",
