      "message": "cellforge v0.1.1: Write-lock safety interlock\n\nAdversary Round 5 (seed_pro) found: 'When dispatcher is in PLAYING mode,\nno external actor may write to canon cells. This is a safety interlock.'\n\nApplied:\n- Workbook.bind_dispatcher(d) - link workbook to dispatcher for lock checks\n- add_cell(force=False) raises PermissionError when mode=PLAYING\n- add_fork(force=False) same protection\n- record_witness() ALWAYS allowed (witness is canon, not a modification)\n- force=True escape hatch for admins\n\n3 new tests (18/18 total now pass):\n- cannot_modify_canon_while_playing\n- force_write_bypasses_lock\n- witness_log_writes_always_allowed\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mavis <noreply@anthropic.com>",
